  "card": "Extracts Guix cross-compilation toolchains from manifest_build.scm into a standalone toolchains.scm module and introduces a linux_static.scm manifest. This unblocks producing static release builds (#25573) and enabling stripped-down libstdc++ builds for smaller binaries (#36193). Changes are restricted to Guix build configuration and environment setup.",
